      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "それでも……それでもね。\r\nこの空の青さだけは、絶対に知っているから……。",
        "official_en": "I know that after everything...there’s that eternal blue.",
        "real_en": "But even so... there’s one thing I know for certain: how blue this sky is..."
      },
