        "official_en_sha256": "dd146492371fe16023ecabd7f31a41d436314b7a9d94062fad12eeda6b4ff2ba"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "それに兄さんのことも……。\r\nもう！　なんなのって感じ。",
        "official_en": "And Evan, too... I mean, what the hell is up with him!?",
        "real_en": "And my older brother, too... Ugh! What's going on with him?"
      },
