        "jp": "もし天風が初代シドで、\r\nその考えが変わってしまったのだとしても。\r\nこの言葉だけは否定させない。",
        "official_en": "Even if Aether is the first Cid...and he’s changed his mind on all that...I won’t let those words be denied.",
        "real_en": "Even if Heavenly Wind Veritas really is the first Cid, and his thinking has changed... I won’t let him deny those words."
      },
