        "official_en_sha256": "e60c23d38b69c04e006df5a01d461cfc9c0287c28cef1a50b990f358d55ef0eb"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "絶対に……諦めたりしない。\r\n世界最高の飛空艇も……シドも……兄さんも。\r\n絶対に。",
        "official_en": "I’m never, ever going to give up. Not on my world-beating airship, not on Cid—and not on Evan. Never.",
        "real_en": "I’ll never give up... Not on the world’s greatest airship, not on Cid, and not on my older brother. Never."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
